    "id": "p30-q7-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "Simplify $\\dfrac{(yz)^{b+c}(zx)^{c+a}(xy)^{a+b}}{x^ay^bz^c}$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(xyz)^{a+b+c}$\n\nCollect the powers of each variable, then combine the equal exponents.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{(yz)^{b+c}(zx)^{c+a}(xy)^{a+b}}{x^ay^bz^c}&=\\frac{y^{b+c}z^{b+c}z^{c+a}x^{c+a}x^{a+b}y^{a+b}}{x^ay^bz^c}\\\\\\frac{(yz)^{b+c}(zx)^{c+a}(xy)^{a+b}}{x^ay^bz^c}&=x^{c+a+a+b-a}y^{b+c+a+b-b}z^{b+c+c+a-c}\\\\\\frac{(yz)^{b+c}(zx)^{c+a}(xy)^{a+b}}{x^ay^bz^c}&=x^{a+b+c}y^{a+b+c}z^{a+b+c}\\\\\\frac{(yz)^{b+c}(zx)^{c+a}(xy)^{a+b}}{x^ay^bz^c}&=(xyz)^{a+b+c}\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 30
  },
